    "body": "The complete Context-path diagnostic found earlier action crossings for recorded `self_transition[3610]` q−1→−2, justifying one coherent native finite comparison. This adds an offline fixed-candidate branch that restores the actual fractional master, changes only that coordinate, preserves every unselected bit/frozen coefficient, exports coherent Source/Cue/Prefix/U bindings and independently reloads before scoring the same18 actual prefixes. Baseline18 arrays/objective are reused; no backward, optimizer or reranking runs. Serving gains no special case.\n\nThe declared finite gate fails. Combined CE rises4.391651926613631→4.8622219108984925, references17→15, and task target mass ANDdenominator remain exactly unchanged. Actual recurrent Context actions change; this is not a hard-path plateau or a temporal-credit/capacity conclusion. The candidate is retained negative, selected_model=false, and parent masters restored. Four old held-input crossings are distinguished from propagated candidate changes and synchronous transition causality from event serialization order.\n\nValidation: measured4ef1517c15ad4f0c543e8e217516043e46c8a65f passes scopedfmt,75 actual Rust example tests and CUDA-feature release build. Exact source mathematical/adversarial reviews pass. The independent saved reader verifies nine Context tensors, sole code change, frozen payloads/rebindings, all18 integer pools/objective/gate, actual candidate-packed Context scores/U chain and divergence: PASS. Five complete-file Rust verifications pass separately; their sealed receipts are reused for reader-only retries. Two failed sealed reader attempts (tuple/list, exact historical bridge projection) are retained and narrowly repaired/reviewed; no model rerun. Final exact-head validation/review is posted before queue.\n\nNative export/reload/evaluation40.139314s/RSS1268044KiB; successful independent arithmetic16.722685s/RSS352908KiB. Exact reviewed runtime beforeevaluation freshly preserved at private HF1956fcd2b5b7e41bb20dfa630a31cc530715b909; complete negative83,316,165B/67files and audits/faults freshly verified at d5dc5d65c90980c677e3ebe011b21ec7878fbba1. CUDA loads/exports existing masters with zero new backward/optimizer; native evaluation uses host integer operators. Existing558870s cumulative projection/noincrement; manual shared runner UNVERIFIED.\n\nAfter actual protected delivery, only saved-only boundary alignment of recorded3610 is declared. Per-term gradients/scalars were not retained by#1947 and remain UNAVAILABLE; PRESENT statuses cannot substitute. No new coordinate/rank/dose/model/gradient is admitted by this negative alone. Previous8/512 retains its original scope; exact unbudgeted useful-model goal remains active.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
